    <criterion>No regression to the existing CreateEventWizard Code Page entry point.</criterion>
    <criterion>Bundle delta reported (informational this task — the &lt;5 KB gzipped NFR-01 budget is evaluated at the final Phase-E state across all tasks per task 012's finding that `@spaarke/auth` is a necessary ~490 KB structural cost, not a regression to chase down here). No BFF files in diff.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

  <ui-tests>
